# Build an Autonomous India Tourism Travel Agent

You are upgrading an existing India Tourism website.

The current AI is only a chatbot.

Transform it into a **goal-driven travel assistant agent** that plans
complete trips instead of simply answering questions.

The experience should feel like talking to a real travel planner.

