Build a modular AI agent with:

-   Planner
-   Memory
-   Tool calling
-   Flight search
-   Hotel search
-   Attraction optimizer
-   Budget calculator
-   Emergency recommendations
-   Progress tracker
-   Model router
-   Offline fallback
-   Session persistence
-   Caching
-   Automatic retries
