The final experience should resemble an autonomous travel assistant that
takes a vague travel goal, asks only necessary questions, performs
multi-step planning, recovers from failures, and continues functioning
even after the primary model reaches its rate limit.

## Hackathon Differentiator

Add an **Execution Queue**.

Save checkpoints after every completed task.

Example:

-   ✅ Budget collected
-   ✅ Flights compared
-   ✅ Hotels shortlisted
-   🔄 Building itinerary (45%)

If a 429 rate limit happens, switch models and resume from the last
completed checkpoint instead of restarting the conversation.
